        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"4746bb64-5250-4e9f-b4fe-bef510bc3bcc\",\"review_text\":\"Great\"},{\"review_id\":\"16fbc07d-4e18-4e3a-a234-f0f87eb41376\",\"review_text\":\"Absolutely brilliant. Can't be happier and every song and Album I want.\"},{\"review_id\":\"e3ff44f8-6ca0-4fbc-a8d7-3e66cb00b9cc\",\"review_text\":\"Bahut hi ganda\"},{\"review_id\":\"ab570d78-a978-4b23-b273-21f5292a42e6\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify!! I know you can show ads and ask listener to buy PREMIUM but lately you have crossed the limit you displayed Ads literally everysingle bloody moment, so for sure I am not going to buy any stupid premium but SPOTIFY UNINSTALLED\"},{\"review_id\":\"be658695-9405-4fbc-9632-ac5d6a31c929\",\"review_text\":\"Helps me a lot to listen to all my favourite music without my phone. Would suggest a search option\"},{\"review_id\":\"52c812cf-a806-4667-af45-07006a17ac04\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing app\"},{\"review_id\":\"400af712-0d94-482c-8ba0-78b4a8fd7c2d\",\"review_text\":\"Variety of music.\"},{\"review_id\":\"049269fa-566a-4a2a-a325-2c0b981ef273\",\"review_text\":\"Simple and endless content from music to podcast and audio books all in one place for a more than a reasonable fee. Didn't think I would move away from physical media year ago but I've had this for years cuz I can't live without it now..discoving new things all the time and keeping up with new stuff and revisiting the old\"},{\"review_id\":\"2103fbf6-1d50-4fbf-99a4-90d05442e625\",\"review_text\":\"Nice and it recommend very good playlist\"},{\"review_id\":\"78551b0b-2993-4200-b3cd-e8322fcafd11\",\"review_text\":\"Spotify is Music 🎶\"}]}"
